---
title: Bellini
servings: 1
tags: [cocktail, sparkling]
source: Classic cocktail, number 47 on Drinks International's 2026 bestselling classics; method written for this repository
---

Pour @peach purée{1.5%fl_oz}(white peach) into a #champagne flute{}(chilled). Add @prosecco{3.5%fl_oz} slowly, stirring gently as it goes in so it doesn't foam over.

> Created by Giuseppe Cipriani at Harry's Bar, Venice. Purée fresh white peaches in summer; frozen purée the rest of the year.
